[en.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_2]
Earth Pony Magic

[en.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_2_desc]
We’ve made groundbreaking progress in unlocking the inherent magic within Earth Ponies themselves. Our fearless Earth Pony soldiers, after undergoing systematic training, will leverage their racial advantages even when facing Pegasi and Unicorns.

[zh.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_2]
陆马魔法

[zh.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_2_desc]
我们对陆马自身蕴含的魔力取得了突破性的研究， 我们无畏的陆马士兵在经过系统性的训练后在面对天马和独角兽时也将发挥自身的种族优势
